# Keep a shell script with Unix line endings. A CRLF file fails on a Linux server, because the
# kernel reads the carriage return as a part of the interpreter path.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The tool writes Markdown with line feeds, and the conversion tests compare bytes. A checkout with
# core.autocrlf must not turn the expected output into CRLF.
Tests/tld19Tests/Fixtures/expected.md text eol=lf

# Word documents and PDF files are binary.
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
